PATCH 230: reconstruct FUN_1000_697e (cell-index-table object count) -- a WORD-table-as-int pointer-scaling
+ base-loss.  Asm-verified vs re_out/fist_dat_image.bin 0x1697e-0x169bf.

Counts, per 4-cell group, the present non-0x17 objects in the 4x4 registration table at DGROUP:0x6d3c
(filled by 43c1/patch 200), storing 4 counts at DGROUP:0x7a14 + marking five flags.  Ghidra typed the WORD
table int* (+4 stride vs asm +2) and read the near-offset entry as a 4-byte int (0xc157c05c = two adjacent
entries) then host-deref'd it -> SIGSEGV.  Rebased through g_mem+0x1c000 with WORD stride + WORD reads.

Cascade-only => BEHAVIOUR-NEUTRAL for the 19 verify flows.  Default boot rc=0, mainmenu unchanged.  Sources
pristine; fist.c via build/.
